{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00580","headline":"郊庙歌辞 释奠文宣王乐章 肃和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 释奠文宣王乐章 肃和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"粤惟上圣，有纵自天。\n傍周万物，俯应千年。\n旧章允着，嘉贽孔虔。\n王化兹首，儒风是宣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00580.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00580","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}